OL,3,GNEWSAFirst Minister's Questions
OL,4,
OL,5,FReform Scotland leader Malcolm Offord
OL,6,Fcriticises John Swinney's "wee day trip
OL,7,Fto Wales" to meet the first ministers
OL,8,Fof Wales and Northern Ireland, adding
OL,9,Fhe should be focussing on the day job.
OL,11,FThe first minister says his government
OL,12,Fis concentrating on its four
OL,13,Fpriorities, including growing the
OL,14,Feconomy and improving public services,
OL,15,Fadding that those aims will thrive
OL,16,Ffurther if Scotland becomes
OL,17,Findependent.
OL,19,FYou can follow events in the Holyrood
OL,20,Fchamber by clicking on the Watch live
OL,21,Ficon at the top of this page
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
